          "Wi-Fi is a wireless networking technology that lets devices connect to a local area network and the internet using radio waves.",
          "Wi-Fi standards like Wi-Fi 6 and Wi-Fi 7 improve speed, capacity, and latency over older versions."
        ],
        "bluetooth": [
          "Bluetooth is a short-range wireless technology for exchanging data between devices like headphones, keyboards, and phones.",
